sequenceDiagram
    actor Main
    participant FW as Fixed Window RateLimiter
    participant SW as Sliding Window RateLimiter

    Main->>FW: allowRequest user1 at t equals 0.0s
    FW-->>Main: true, opens the window

    Main->>FW: allowRequest user1 at t equals 9.8s
    FW-->>Main: true
    Main->>FW: allowRequest user1 at t equals 9.9s
    FW-->>Main: true

    Main->>FW: allowRequest user1 at t equals 10.0s
    Note over FW: elapsed since window start is 10s, the whole window resets to zero
    FW-->>Main: true

    Main->>FW: allowRequest user1 at t equals 10.05s
    Note over FW: incorrect, five requests now sit inside the trailing 10s span
    FW-->>Main: true

    Main->>SW: allowRequest user1 at t equals 0.0s
    SW-->>Main: true
    Main->>SW: allowRequest user1 at t equals 9.8s
    SW-->>Main: true
    Main->>SW: allowRequest user1 at t equals 9.9s
    SW-->>Main: true

    Main->>SW: allowRequest user1 at t equals 10.0s
    Note over SW: the t equals 0.0s entry ages out alone, there is no wholesale reset
    SW-->>Main: true

    Main->>SW: allowRequest user1 at t equals 10.05s
    Note over SW: three entries are still inside the trailing 10s window
    SW-->>Main: false, correctly rejected
